# Project overview

## Product
- **Tutoring Manager** (display name overridable via env): academy tutoring platform focused on **teachers**, also used by **academy admins** and **students/parents**.
- Single-academy deployment (not multi-academy SaaS). Multiple teachers, students, and parents may register within that academy.

## Users & tenancy
- Roles: teacher, academy admin, student/parent.
- Data boundary is the **academy (organization)**; access within it is controlled by **role/permissions** (not “one teacher owns all rows in isolation”).

## In scope (v1)
- Students CRUD; subjects/curriculum.
- Lesson calendar; complete / makeup / cancel.
- Progress, special notes (특이사항), parent comments — **not** a grades-centric model.
- File/Excel progress import.
- Weekly report **UI only** (no email — see `tech-stack.mdc`).
- Hourly pay: **policies change over time**; each lesson uses the policy **in effect at lesson time**.
- Parent/student portal: view that student’s lesson calendar; view per-lesson parent comments.

## Out of scope (unless explicitly requested)
- Weekly report email.
- Multi-academy / white-label SaaS tenancy.
- Native mobile apps.

## Language
- Default UI copy: **Korean**, with translation support for overseas students.
- Source code, identifiers, and commit messages: **English** (sensible defaults; no forced literal translation of every domain term in UI strings stored as data).
